16.29.2

\(\frac{\vartheta_{z}^{\prime}(u)}{\vartheta_{z}(u)} = - \tan u + 4\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}{(-1)^{n}\frac{q^{n}}{1 - q^{2n}}\sin 2nu}\)

16.30.1

\(\ln\frac{\vartheta_{z}(a + \beta)}{\vartheta_{z}(a - \beta)} = \ln\frac{\sin\,(\alpha + \beta)}{\sin\,(\alpha - \beta)}\)

16.30.2

\(\ln\frac{\vartheta_{z}(a + \beta)}{\vartheta_{z}(a - \beta)} = \ln\frac{\cos\,(\alpha + \beta)}{\cos\,(\alpha - \beta)}\)

\(+4\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}{\frac{(-1)^{n}}{n}\frac{q^{2n}}{1 - q^{2n}}\sin 2n\alpha\sin 2n\beta}\)

16.30.3

\(\ln\frac{\vartheta_{z}(a + \beta)}{\vartheta_{z}(a - \beta)} = \ln\frac{\cos\,(\alpha + \beta)}{\cos\,(\alpha - \beta)}\)

\(+4\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}{\frac{(-1)^{n}}{n}\frac{q^{2n}}{1 - q^{2n}}\sin 2n\alpha\sin 2n\beta}\)

16.30.4

\(\ln\frac{\vartheta_{z}(\alpha + \beta)}{\vartheta_{z}(\alpha - \beta)} \to 4\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}{\frac{1}{n}\frac{q^{n}}{1 - q^{2n}}\sin 2n\alpha\sin 2n\beta}\)

The corresponding expressions when \(\beta = i\gamma\) are easily deduced by use of the formulae 4.3.55 and 4.3.56.

